Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
================================================================================

The derived portions have been modified. The material changes are:

1. The product name, package scope and all in-code identifiers were renamed.
   The upstream product name is a reserved trademark of its owner and is not
   used by this project except in this notice and in the licence file, where
   attribution requires it.

2. Enterprise-edition code was removed. The upstream repository contains a
   directory of separately licensed, non-redistributable Enterprise Edition
   files. Those files are excluded from this distribution entirely; build and
   runtime paths that referenced them degrade through the existing feature-gate
   switches rather than through a missing-module failure.

3. Continuous-integration and verification wiring was rewritten so that a green
   check reflects commands that actually passed, replacing steps that could not
   fail.

4. Interface and branding changes were applied to the user-facing surfaces
   (console, widget and documentation).

Nothing in this notice grants permission to use the upstream project's trade
